{"id":"637901","name":"自制酱瓜","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/637901/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青瓜","amount":"5根"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"4勺"},{"name":"酱油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"零卡糖","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：青瓜、盐、酱油、零卡糖。","img":"images/637901/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将青瓜清洗清洗捞出。","img":"images/637901/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放在案板上切成条。","img":"images/637901/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入瓦缸里，加4勺盐。","img":"images/637901/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"揉搓片刻。","img":"images/637901/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"用装入清水的砂锅压上，腌制30分钟。","img":"images/637901/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"接着，将腌制好的青瓜，用清水清洗2——3遍捞出。","img":"images/637901/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"沥干水分。","img":"images/637901/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"然后，加入酱油和青瓜持平。","img":"images/637901/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入零卡糖。","img":"images/637901/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"搅一搅。","img":"images/637901/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"最后，盖上盖等待1天可以吃吃了。（随吃随取）","img":"images/637901/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}